## Plugin File Structure

```
[PluginName]/
├── org.minsol.[PluginName]/
│   ├── org.minsol.[PluginName].csproj
│   ├── Blocks/
│   │   └── [BlockName]/
│   │       └── [BlockName].cs
│   ├── Enums/
│   │   └── [EnumName].cs              ← only when no Rock core enum exists
│   ├── Model/
│   │   └── [EntityName].cs
│   ├── SystemGuid/
│   │   └── [EntityName].cs
│   └── ViewModels/
│       └── Blocks/
│           └── [BlockName]/
│               ├── [BlockName]Box.cs
│               ├── [BlockName]Bag.cs
│               ├── [BlockName]OptionsBag.cs
│               └── [BlockName]SaveRequestBag.cs  ← if block saves data
└── org.minsol.[PluginName].Obsidian/
    ├── org.minsol.[PluginName].Obsidian.esproj
    ├── obsidian.config.json
    ├── package.json
    ├── tsconfig.base.json
    └── src/
        ├── tsconfig.json              ← second tsconfig, inside src/
        ├── shims-obs.d.ts
        ├── enums.partial.ts           ← AUTO-GENERATED by viewmodels, never edit
        ├── ViewModels/                ← AUTO-GENERATED by viewmodels, never edit
        │   ├── bags.d.ts              ← flat — no subfolders
        │   └── boxes.d.ts
        └── Core/
            ├── [blockName].obs        ← root component, orchestrates only
            ├── utils.ts               ← ALL shared helper functions
            └── [SubComponentName].obs ← one file per sub-component
```

