### org.minsol.[PluginName].csproj
Location: `[PluginName]/org.minsol.[PluginName]/org.minsol.[PluginName].csproj`

```xml
<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net472</TargetFramework>
    <Version>1.0.0</Version>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup>
    <RockWebPath>..\..\RockWeb</RockWebPath>
    <AdditionalAssembliesToCopy></AdditionalAssembliesToCopy>
    <CopyToRockWeb>true</CopyToRockWeb>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="EntityFramework" Version="6.4.4" />
    <PackageReference Include="Newtonsoft.Json" Version="13.0.1" />
    <PackageReference Include="SparkDevNetwork.Rock.Build.Tasks" Version="1.0.0-rc.4" />
    <PackageReference Include="SparkDevNetwork.Rock.Analyzers" Version="1.0.0-rc.1" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.AspNet.WebApi.Core" Version="5.2.3" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\Rock\Rock.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\Rock.Rest\Rock.Rest.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\DotLiquid\DotLiquid.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\Rock.Lava.Shared\Rock.Lava.Shared.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Reference Include="Microsoft.Data.Edm">
      <HintPath>..\..\RockWeb\Bin\Microsoft.Data.Edm.dll</HintPath>
    </Reference>
    <Reference Include="Microsoft.Data.OData">
      <HintPath>..\..\RockWeb\Bin\Microsoft.Data.OData.dll</HintPath>
    </Reference>
    <Reference Include="System.Web" />
    <Reference Include="System.Web.Extensions" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
```

Key properties:
- `CopyToRockWeb` — automatically copies the compiled DLL to `RockWeb/bin/`
- `ProjectReference` entries — wire Rock core dependencies at the solution level
- `SparkDevNetwork.Rock.Build.Tasks` — handles DLL deployment and build automation

